1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,132
Transcription.

2
00:00:01,132 --> 00:00:13,658
RNA polymerase binds a promoter, opens a short stretch of DNA, and copies just one strand, the template strand, adding ribonucleotides five prime to three prime.

3
00:00:13,658 --> 00:00:17,135
Opposite every A it puts U, not T.

